From: Eric Guo <eric.guo@nxp.com>
Date: Tue, 6 Feb 2024 13:29:01 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 2/4] Use rvgpu firmware to render triangle

export MESA_SW=1 to force softpipe rendering

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [i.MX specific]
Signed-off-by: Eric Guo <eric.guo@nxp.com>
